; $00:8000 = PC $000000; $01:8000 = PC $008000; $1F:FFFF = PC $0FFFFF.
; $80-$9F are ROM aliases, not extra capacity. CPU aliases may not be behaviorally
; interchangeable: program/data bank state and bank-relative access matter.
