; PC $007FD9: $01 destination; $007FDA: $BA maker; $007FDB: $00 version.
; PC $007FDC-$007FDD: $9A8D checksum complement, little-endian.
; PC $007FDE-$007FDF: $6572 checksum, little-endian.
; Measured sum of all supplied US bytes & $FFFF = $6572; complement XOR = $FFFF.
