; PC $007FE6 / CPU $00:FFE6: native BRK   -> $00:F12C
; PC $007FE8 / CPU $00:FFE8: native ABORT -> $00:F12C
; PC $007FEA / CPU $00:FFEA: native NMI   -> $00:8E69
; PC $007FEE / CPU $00:FFEE: native IRQ   -> $00:8E41
; PC $007FF4 / CPU $00:FFF4: emulation COP   -> $00:F12C
; PC $007FF8 / CPU $00:FFF8: emulation ABORT -> $00:F12C
; PC $007FFA / CPU $00:FFFA: emulation NMI   -> $00:F12C
; PC $007FFC / CPU $00:FFFC: reset           -> $00:EE7B
; PC $007FFE / CPU $00:FFFE: emulation IRQ/BRK -> $00:F12C
; Reserved vector-area words remain reserved, not available patch space.
