; $8163-$817A / PC $008163-$00817A is12 WORD POINTERS, not instructions:
; IDX TARGET    NATIVE OPERATION AT TARGET
;  0  01:8238   build pointer $00:EE87 in DP $00..$02, JMP [$0000]
;  1  01:817B   JSL $04:8524, then $80CF re-entry
;  2  01:803A   checkpoint/map/player setup, then scene setup
;  3  01:8182   checkpoint+$C0 through $04:85B1; solo inactive HP clear
;  4  01:81A4   $10D8/$10D9 -> scene map $10D1/$10D2; $808C
;  5  01:81B3   $10D8 through $04:85B1, player state checks; $817B
;  6  01:824A   JSL $05:E79B -> $05:821C, then RTS (special stack context)
;  7  01:81A4   same as4
;  8  01:81EF   checkpoint map fallback, then $808C
;  9  01:8214   JMP $80CF
; 10  01:8238   same as0
; 11  01:8238   same as0
; No bounds check in this dispatch;12 verified index calculations stop before
; indirect JMP. Table size is storage evidence, not proof all12 are legal modes.
; $10DA is a scene/exit REQUEST, not a universal current-mode enum: inner loops
; clear it and continue while zero. High-bit combat exit is consumed at $05:8A29.
