; COMBAT LOOP IS A MULTIPHASE SCHEDULE
; $05:E793 -> $87EC performs combat entry; at $88CF JSR $89A1 runs loop.
; $89A1 increments $104C; calls $ABE7 for player offsets0/$0A and $06:8341.
; $06:8341 -> $BA73 saves DBR/PHK/PLB and performs actor/sprite preparation;
