; 03M. INTERRUPT COMMAND DISPATCH, PALETTE AND AUDIO UPLOAD -- 2026-10-11
; ============================================================================
; Build/verify_interrupt_commands.py:1074 bounded original-instruction checks;
; Research/interrupt_command_results.json holds counts, dispatch tables and static
; audio block headers/hashes. Fixed PBR=DBR00/80, DP0, synthetic inputs; no full
; interpreter, PPU/APU, interrupt, patched-alias or timing simulation.
