; SOUND REQUEST HELPER $00:8929-$89AD / PC $000929-$0009AD
; PHP/SEP30/PHX; input A8=0 does nothing. Inputs1-FC translate through explicit
; long table $0A:7FFF,X (first used entry0A:8000). Result0 does nothing.
; Result bit7 CLEAR: if same as $0420, return; otherwise write result->$0420,
; long lookup $0A:8220,result. FF skips upload; otherwise compare/update $0846,
